      "note": "Read from his finished drawing, not construction instructions. His references are Jules Bourgoin, Arabic Geometrical Pattern and Design (Dover, 1973), plate 149 (top), and S. J. Abas and A. S. Salman, Symmetries of Islamic Geometrical Patterns (World Scientific, 1995), page 285."
